{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11203130","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11203130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1120313001:1":{"text":"妙やな。この子、最近誰かを怒らせたり、恨みを買ったりしたんか？","source_cn":"奇怪？这孩子最近有得罪过什么人吗？或者是有什么仇家之类的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFFFDD2BE2E62557","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120313002:1":{"text":"たぶんない……はず。僕たちウール族はみんな仲良しだし……","source_cn":"没有……吧？在我们乌尔氏族，大家相处的都挺好的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x585508D4325653E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120313003:1":{"text":"ふむ……じゃあ最近、なんか妙なもんを食べたとかは？","source_cn":"嗯……那她这几天有没有吃什么乱七八糟的东西？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5FDBF94A709A598","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120313004:1":{"text":"それは……分からない。子どもってしょっちゅう変なものを口に入れちゃうから……","source_cn":"这个……我不太确定。你知道的，小孩子经常容易把奇怪的东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0BE5E0A6778EDB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120313005:1":{"text":"あー、それもそうやな。モンモンたちは腹が減ったら何でも口に入れてまうねん。ワイが止めたら不機嫌になるし……","source_cn":"啊呀，说的也是，蒙蒙他们要是肚子饿了，什么都能往嘴里塞...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFA3B179D1636EA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","doc